---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import moegnLogo from '../images/MOEGN_LOGO_pink.png';
import moeqyLogo from '../images/MOEQY_LOGO.png';
import blogLogo from '../images/blogLOGO.png';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="editorial-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
        <div class="footer-top">
            <div class="footer-brand"><a href="/" aria-label="MOEGN 首页"><Image src={moegnLogo} alt="MOEGN" width={144} /></a><p>为玩家发出次元之声。</p><span>Anime / Game / Review Archive</span></div>
            <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="页脚导航"><h2>继续探索</h2><a href="/reviews/">评测档案 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/collections/">私人收藏 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/generator/">创建卡片 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
            <div class="footer-friends"><h2>在这里，也能找到我们</h2><a href="https://blog.moeqy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><Image src={blogLogo} alt="MqyGalaxy Blog" /><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><Image class="moeqy-mark" src={moeqyLogo} alt="MOEQY" /></div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-about"><h2>关于我们</h2><p>为玩家发出次元之声！MOEGN 始终保持以大众的视角来评测面向大众的作品，而非受到基于政治、地域、国家、性别、种族、歧视等方面的影响。并且 MOEGN 希望能够支持大众参与并发布属于自己的声音，让评测不仅仅只是基于一些“官方媒体”的评论。</p></div>
        <div class="footer-legal"><p>网站所涉及的公司名称、商标、产品等均为其各自所有者的资产，仅供识别。<br />网站内使用的部分图片、动画、音频、文本原文，仅用于更好地表现作品资料，并有助于评测分析和阅读。相关版权均为其各自所有者的资产。</p><p>除非另有声明，网站其他内容均采用 知识共享署名-非商业性使用-相同方式共享 授权。</p></div>
        <div class="footer-bottom"><span>Copyright © {currentYear} MOEGN. Some rights reserved.</span><span>记录热爱 · 保留真实</span></div>
    </div>
</footer>

<style>
    .editorial-footer { margin-top: 80px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ui-line); background: var(--color-pink-light-a3); color: var(--ui-muted); }
    .footer-inner { width: min(var(--ui-page-width), 100%); padding: 52px var(--ui-gutter) 24px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .footer-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr .7fr 1fr; gap: 48px; padding-bottom: 40px; }
    .footer-brand > a { display: inline-block; }
    .footer-brand img { width: 144px; height: auto; }
    .footer-brand p { margin: 12px 0 2px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ui-ink); }
    .footer-brand > span { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: var(--font-medium); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: var(--ui-ink); }
    .footer-nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; }
    .footer-nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; min-height: 36px; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-nav a span { color: var(--ui-accent); }
    .footer-friends a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; width: fit-content; min-height: 44px; text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-friends a img { width: 170px; height: auto; }
    .moeqy-mark { width: auto; height: 24px; margin-top: 16px; opacity: .65; }
    .footer-about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr; gap: 24px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ui-line); }
    .footer-about h2 { margin-top: 2px; }
    .footer-about p { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.9; }
    .footer-legal { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.9; }
    .footer-legal p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ui-line); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .3px; }
    a:hover { color: var(--ui-accent); }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ui-accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .editorial-footer { margin-top: 48px; } .footer-inner { padding: 36px var(--ui-gutter) 24px; } .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; } .footer-brand { grid-column: 1 / -1; } .footer-about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; } .footer-friends a img { width: 130px; } .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; } }
</style>
